# Installing libquantum

This document describes how to build and install **libquantum** using the [Meson build system](https://mesonbuild.com/).

## Prerequisites

Make sure you have the following installed:

- Meson
- Ninja 
- C compiler

## Build and Install

Follow these steps to build and install `libquantum`:

1. Clone or download the `libquantum` source code.

2. Open a terminal and navigate to the root of the source tree:

   ```sh
   cd /path/to/libquantum

3. Set up the build directory and configure the project with a specified installation prefix:

   ```sh
   meson setup /path/to/builddir

4. Install the library to the specified prefix:
	
   ```sh
   meson install -C /path/to/builddir
